        "name": "It's Not You, It's M.E",
        "steam_appid": 4109440,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1cfee5e12bc62e463c62af7dd2f1ab3c.avif?t=1768688010\" width=1200 height=250 /></span>A short single session game about living with chronic health issues. <strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>It’s Not You, It’s M.E. is a short, emotional story you can’t “win.”</strong><br>Created by a solo developer, it follows one exhausting week where simple tasks, small choices, and normal daily life quietly become overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <strong>the lived experience of Long Covid and M.E.</strong>, the game offers a grounded, compassionate look at chronic fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a brief (around 10 minutes) point-and-click narrative with small interactions and hidden mini-games that sometimes feel impossible to complete… because that’s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1c7d118a5c90cba190f5ee62c044eec6.poster.avif?t=1768688010\" width=250 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1c7d118a5c90cba190f5ee62c044eec6.webm?t=1768688010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring original music by Jack The Robot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with support from <strong>Disability and Deaf Arts Fest</strong> and <strong>FACT Gallery</strong>, and made possible thanks to public funding from the <strong>National Lottery through Arts Council England</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1cfee5e12bc62e463c62af7dd2f1ab3c.avif?t=1768688010\" width=1200 height=250 /></span>A short single session game about living with chronic health issues. <strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>It’s Not You, It’s M.E. is a short, emotional story you can’t “win.”</strong><br>Created by a solo developer, it follows one exhausting week where simple tasks, small choices, and normal daily life quietly become overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <strong>the lived experience of Long Covid and M.E.</strong>, the game offers a grounded, compassionate look at chronic fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a brief (around 10 minutes) point-and-click narrative with small interactions and hidden mini-games that sometimes feel impossible to complete… because that’s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1c7d118a5c90cba190f5ee62c044eec6.poster.avif?t=1768688010\" width=250 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1c7d118a5c90cba190f5ee62c044eec6.webm?t=1768688010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring original music by Jack The Robot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with support from <strong>Disability and Deaf Arts Fest</strong> and <strong>FACT Gallery</strong>, and made possible thanks to public funding from the <strong>National Lottery through Arts Council England</strong>.</p>",
        "short_description": "A short narrative point-and-click about living with limited energy — and how even the smallest tasks can feel impossible.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
